# Hermes environment — copy to ~/.hermes/.env and fill in.
# Secrets live here. Never commit this file with real values.

# --- Model provider (pick ONE path; see STARTER.md Step 2) ---
# Path B (default): OpenRouter or OpenAI key
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# Path A (Claude subscription via Claude Code): configured through `hermes model` / portal, not a raw key here.
# Path C (local): no key needed; point hermes at your local endpoint.

# --- Telegram (Step 4) ---
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456:ABC...
# Only YOUR user id. Comma-separated if truly more than one person.
# TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_USERS=123456789
# NEVER set this to true on a bot that can run commands:
# GATEWAY_ALLOW_ALL_USERS=false

# --- Spend guardrail ---
# Set a monthly cap so a runaway loop can't run up a bill.
# MONTHLY_SPEND_CAP_USD=25

# --- Google Workspace (Ramp #3 / inbox) is set up via the google-workspace SKILL + OAuth,
#     not env keys here. See recipes/gmail-multi-account.md.
